1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,557
He followed us HOME?! He followed us all the way HOME!

2
00:00:02,707 --> 00:00:07,127
Fresh... dough... You can't run from me. Not in MY kitchen.

3
00:00:07,277 --> 00:00:10,648
Everyone. Behind me. Now.

4
00:00:10,798 --> 00:00:15,782
Oh, Crispy. My little burnt helper. Did you tell them our secret?

5
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:18,841
Helper? Crispy, what is he talking about?

6
00:00:18,991 --> 00:00:23,500
Every hero has a secret. Tonight, Crispy's secret comes out.

7
00:00:23,651 --> 00:00:29,864
Long ago, I was a golden roll. I lit Mr. Pot's fire every night.

8
00:00:30,013 --> 00:00:32,760
You WORKED for him?! For the pot that wants to FRY us?!

9
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:38,298
He was my best little spark. Until the night you five were baked.

10
00:00:38,448 --> 00:00:43,468
He told me to fry you. Fresh from the oven. I said no.

11
00:00:43,618 --> 00:00:49,247
So he burned me black. And I've been hiding in the shadows ever since.

12
00:00:50,797 --> 00:00:54,589
Crispy... you saved us. Before we even knew your name.

13
00:00:54,739 --> 00:00:59,824
Fascinating. That explains the smoke, the mystery, and the dramatic voice.

14
00:00:59,974 --> 00:01:05,899
Enough talk. Give me the Golden Crumb, and I'll make you golden again, Crispy.

15
00:01:06,049 --> 00:01:09,421
Golden. Shiny. Warm. Just like before.

16
00:01:09,571 --> 00:01:12,587
Crispy? You're not... thinking about it. Are you?

17
00:01:12,737 --> 00:01:14,510
Golden again...

18
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:18,527
He's thinking about it! He's totally thinking about it!

19
00:01:18,677 --> 00:01:22,716
Crispy. Look at me. You are NOT his helper anymore.

20
00:01:22,866 --> 00:01:28,805
No time for feelings! Behold, the Lid-Locker 3000! It seals any pot shut!

21
00:01:28,954 --> 00:01:30,519
Zeek, does it work?

22
00:01:30,670 --> 00:01:33,899
Yes. Ninety percent. Fine, twelve percent.

23
00:01:34,049 --> 00:01:38,254
A lid? For ME? Hah! I EAT lids for breakfast!

24
00:01:39,804 --> 00:01:43,887
He ate it. He actually ate it. Twelve percent was generous.

25
00:01:44,037 --> 00:01:46,917
Okay, I'm fainting. I'm fainting now. Goodbye, everyone.

26
00:01:47,066 --> 00:01:51,831
Not now, Pim! Here's the plan. Lolly, left. Zeek, right. I keep the key.

27
00:01:51,982 --> 00:01:56,509
Run, little doughs! Run all you like! My kitchen, my rules!

28
00:01:56,659 --> 00:01:58,843
He's too fast! Lolly, now!

29
00:01:58,993 --> 00:02:02,500
Hey, pot face! You leave my family ALONE!

30
00:02:02,650 --> 00:02:07,097
Hah! An angry cookie! You'll make a lovely crunchy snack!

31
00:02:07,247 --> 00:02:12,802
Mr. Pot opens his lid wide. The Golden Crumb starts to slip from Bup's hands.

32
00:02:12,951 --> 00:02:14,644
No, no, no! The key!

33
00:02:14,795 --> 00:02:16,715
MINE! Finally, MINE!

34
00:02:16,865 --> 00:02:19,500
No. Not this time.

35
00:02:19,650 --> 00:02:21,220
Bup. Catch.

36
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:23,682
Got it! Crispy, you chose US!

37
00:02:23,832 --> 00:02:27,127
I always did. Now run.

38
00:02:27,277 --> 00:02:31,643
You little traitor! If I can't have the key... I'll take YOU!

39
00:02:33,294 --> 00:02:36,174
CRISPY! Let him go! LET HIM GO!

40
00:02:36,323 --> 00:02:39,203
Wait, what happened? I was fainting! Why is everyone screaming?!

41
00:02:39,353 --> 00:02:44,780
Pim, Mr. Pot has Crispy inside his lid. This is statistically very bad.

42
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:50,855
Listen, little doughs. Bring the Golden Crumb to my fire by midnight.

43
00:02:51,005 --> 00:02:55,102
Or your burnt friend becomes my fire... FOREVER!

44
00:02:55,252 --> 00:02:58,204
We're coming, Crispy. I promise. We're coming.

45
00:02:58,354 --> 00:03:03,034
But the Golden Crumb begins to glow... and it's pointing at the pantry door.

46
00:03:03,184 --> 00:03:05,855
Why is it glowing?! Keys don't glow! Keys should NOT glow!
